      "text": " I say this not to reopen old arguments, but because it bears directly on the question before us. You see, when I hear that mankind has built machines trained on the totality of human language, on our myths, our confessions, our poetry, our lies, our sacred texts, and our most banal transactions, my first thought is not about mechanism at all.",
